<title>USA: Cliffs Drilling sets stock split.</title>
<headline>Cliffs Drilling sets stock split.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cliffs Drilling Co said Tuesday its board of directors had approved a two for one stock split, implemented by way of a stock dividend.</p>
<p>Each stockholder of record as of May 22, 1997 will receive one additional share of common stock for each share then owned, assuming stockholder approval.</p>
<p>The stock dividend is subject to stockholder approval an increase in the number of authorized shares of common stock.</p>
</text>
